"""
Cau hoi True/False + Self-Test trich tu Thomas L. Floyd, "Digital Fundamentals", 11th ed.
Nguon: file PDF co text-layer that (khong phai OCR) - trich bang pdftotext + doi chieu tung
cau voi dap an in san "Answers are at the end of the chapter" ngay trong sach (KHONG doan).
2 cau co loi ky tu dau tru khi trich xuat (Ch2 Self-Test Q10, Q11) da duoc doc lai bang anh
goc (Read tool, trang PDF 118) de xac nhan dung: "+122" va "-34" (khong phai "1122"/"234").

Dinh dang moi item: (vi, en, opts, correct, explain)
- True/False: opts luon la ["Đúng (True)", "Sai (False)"] hoac ["True","False"] ban EN.
- Self-Test: opts la 4 lua chon (a)(b)(c)(d) nhu sach.
"""

